      "name": "Range cards",
      "settings": {
        "caption": "Specialist Ranges",
        "heading": "Tailored Professional Skincare Regimes",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "intro": "<p>Cantabria Labs professional skincare regimes provide scientific solutions for anti-ageing, pigmentation, reactive & redness-prone skin, acne-prone skin, and hair and scalp concerns.</p><p>Each regime, with evidence-based products and key combinations, is supported by HELIOCARE 360° high-level full-spectrum photoprotection targeted to skin type, finish, or concern.</p><p>The Cantabria Labs portfolio enables these solutions to be tailored to an individual’s skin concerns and needs, providing efficacy with accessibility and flexibility.</p>",
        "columns_desktop": 3,
        "more_label": "View more",
